{"lessonId":27,"version":"d22c83792f65","questions":[{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:10","wordId":"adhere-to-27","prompt":"When using these facilities, please ________ to the rules posted by the door.","answer":"adhere","options":["adhere","adhering","adherence","adhered"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:11","wordId":"conclude-27","prompt":"As the chairman stood to give his ________ everyone in the room was listening.","answer":"conclusion","options":["conclusion","conclude","conclusive","concluding"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:12","wordId":"lengthy-27","prompt":"George decided to ________ his business trip by a few days so he could do some sightseeing.","answer":"lengthen","options":["length","lengthen","lengthy","lengthened"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:13","wordId":"periodically-27","prompt":"The original members of the committee met ________ for lunch or dinner.","answer":"periodically","options":["period","periods","periodically","periodic"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:14","wordId":"priority-27","prompt":"As her first ________ the committee chairwoman wanted to attract new, energetic members to the group.","answer":"priority","options":["prior","priority","prioritize","prioritized"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:27:15","wordId":"progress-27","prompt":"Even as they ________ through the hundreds of pages of supporting material, the committee was still not convinced that the project was justified.","answer":"progressed","options":["progression","progressed","progresses","progressive"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:adhere-to-27:1","wordId":"adhere-to-27","prompt":"The best committee members are those who ________ the time limits and speak only when they have something important to add.","answer":"adhere to","options":["adhere to","inspect","solve","enhance"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:agenda-27:0","wordId":"agenda-27","prompt":"The board was able to cover fifteen items on the ________.","answer":"agenda","options":["agenda","brand","decade","responsibility"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:go-ahead-27:0","wordId":"go-ahead-27","prompt":"Five of the six members felt that they should ________ with the plan.","answer":"go ahead","options":["go ahead","inspect","take back","solve"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:goal-27:1","wordId":"goal-27","prompt":"The director had to report to the committee that his department would not reach its ________ of 35 percent growth.","answer":"goal","options":["goal","disruption","option","agenda"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:lengthy-27:0","wordId":"lengthy-27","prompt":"After ________ discussions, the chairperson was reelected for another term.","answer":"lengthy","options":["lengthy","apprehensive","open to","adjacent"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:periodically-27:0","wordId":"periodically-27","prompt":"The group tried to meet ________.","answer":"periodically","options":["periodically","uniformly","inconsiderately","systematically"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:priority-27:0","wordId":"priority-27","prompt":"Since the remaining issues were not a ________, the group decided to move them to the next week's agenda.","answer":"priority","options":["priority","decade","goal","garment"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:progress-27:0","wordId":"progress-27","prompt":"The executive committee asked each group to present a report showing their ________ for the year.","answer":"progress","options":["progress","brand","disruption","option"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:waste-27:1","wordId":"waste-27","prompt":"The meeting wasn't a ________ of time, but the members had hoped to accomplish more than they did.","answer":"waste","options":["waste","conform","bring up","throw out"],"sourceVersion":"d22c83792f65"}]}
